  m_text: "The Cambrian era ended with what scientists call a mass extinction event,
    in which 90% of the species would disappear forever. \n\nThe creatures to survive
    this mass extinction would continue on in the story of earth... and we'll learn
    about them in the next book, the Ordovician. "
