  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Authors Note:


    What suprised me the most while doing research about
    the Cambrian was a) the diversity and complexity of animals, and b) truly how
    small all the organisms were. The largest predator, for example, was the size
    of a large dog. Most organisms were about the size of a house key. It turns out
    the Cambrian was a rich and diverse landscape full of tiny swimming creatures.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 756a8c9b083f04819b8b1c63c736172c, type: 2}
